class Book {
    private final Queue<Reservation> reservations = new LinkedList<>();   // FIFO = fairness

    void reserve(Member m) { reservations.add(new Reservation(m, LocalDateTime.now())); }

    // called when any copy of this title is returned (Observer callback)
    void onCopyReturned(BookItem item) {
        Reservation next = reservations.poll();      // head of queue
        if (next != null) {
            item.markReserved();
            NotificationService.notify(next.member(), "Your reserved book is available");
        } else {
            item.markAvailable();
        }
    }
}
record Reservation(Member member, LocalDateTime at) {}
```
*FIFO `Queue` guarantees first-come-first-served; the returned copy is held for the head member.*

