abstract class User {
    protected final String id;
    User(String id) { this.id = id; }
    abstract boolean canManageCatalog();
}
class Member extends User {
    Member(String id) { super(id); }
    boolean canManageCatalog() { return false; }   // borrow/reserve only
}
class Librarian extends User {
    Librarian(String id) { super(id); }
    boolean canManageCatalog() { return true; }     // add/remove books, waive fines
}
// callers check user.canManageCatalog() before privileged actions
```
*Inheritance models the IS-A (Librarian IS-A User) and centralizes permission rules.*
